      "reading-ctw-academic-b"
     ],
     "practice": {
      "lesson": "reading-complete-words",
      "title": "2 段 20 空 · 5 分钟",
      "brief": [
       "先看所缺字母数，再看空格前后各一个词。",
       "短空多为功能词：根据后面是否为名词、前面动词的介词搭配、所指对象判断。",
       "长空先定词性：the 或形容词之后为名词；to 或 will 之后为动词原形。",
       "单个空超过 10 秒先跳过，完成全段后再回来。"
      ],
      "points": {
       "function": "reading-ctw-function-a",
       "content": "reading-ctw-collocation"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "title": "日常文字　Read in Daily Life",
     "lessons": [
      "reading-daily-method",
      "reading-daily-notice",
      "reading-daily-email",
      "reading-daily-messages",
      "reading-daily-numbers",
      "reading-daily-inference"
     ],
     "practice": {
      "lesson": "reading-daily-life",
      "title": "3 段 8 题 · 6 分钟",
      "brief": [
       "先读题干，再读文字。",
       "目的题看标题、主题行和第一句；细节题看数字、日期，以及 but、unless、only 之后的内容。",
       "短信中的口语和省略写法按意思理解。",
       "时间、地点、人物与原文不符的选项可直接排除。"
      ],
      "points": {
       "purpose": "reading-daily-method",
       "detail": "reading-daily-numbers",
       "informal": "reading-daily-messages"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "title": "学术短文　Read an Academic Passage",
     "lessons": [
      "reading-passage-structure",
      "reading-passage-fact",
      "reading-passage-vocab",
      "reading-passage-inference",
      "reading-passage-purpose",
      "reading-passage-relation",
      "reading-passage-traps",
      "reading-passage-sentences",
      "reading-passage-life",
      "reading-passage-earth",
      "reading-passage-society"
     ],
     "practice": {
      "lesson": "reading-academic",
      "title": "1 篇 5 题 · 6 分钟",
      "brief": [
       "先读第一段，判断文章结构（旧观点与新发现、现象与解释、问题与解决），再读题。",
       "事实信息题：用题干中的词定位原文，正确选项是该句的同义改写。",
       "词义题：把四个选项逐一代入原句。",
       "推断题和目的题：只推一步；例子服务于它前面的论点。",
       "原文中找不到依据的选项不选。"
      ],
      "points": {
       "locate": "reading-passage-fact",
       "infer": "reading-passage-inference",
       "structure": "reading-passage-purpose"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "title": "模拟测试",
     "lessons": [
      "reading-mock"
     ]
    }
